  "message": "{code, select, operationFailed {Operation failed. Check the status and try again.} storageUnavailable {Local data could not be opened. Check available device storage.} engineUnavailable {Speech engine unavailable. Use the iOS or Android app.} finishBeforeModelChange {Finish recording before loading or switching a model.} finishRecordingFirst {Finish the current recording first.} modelPrepareFailed {Model preparation failed. Check your connection and storage, then retry.} modelDeleteFailed {Model deletion failed. Check device storage and try again.} downloadModelFirst {Download and prepare an offline model in Settings first.} speechStartFailed {Could not start recording. Check microphone permission and model status.} speechInterrupted {Recording interrupted. Confirmed text has been kept.} audioInterrupted {Audio was interrupted by the system. Confirmed text was kept. Stop and start again.} speechProcessingPaused {Speech processing paused. Check storage or switch to Small. Confirmed text has been kept.} transcriptSaveFailed {Text could not be saved. Check storage. Native records will be recovered at the next launch.} speechStopFailed {Could not finish processing. Confirmed text has been kept.} schedulingFailed {Analysis scheduling is unavailable. Transcription is still kept.} unsupportedInterval {Unsupported analysis interval.} unsupportedLocale {Unsupported app language.} unsupportedAnalysisLanguage {Unsupported analysis output language.} configurationClearFailed {Configuration not cleared. Check system secure storage availability.} enterApiKey {Enter this provider’s API key.} invalidTemplate {Enter a template name and rules of up to 4,000 characters.} invalidEndpoint {Use a valid HTTPS base URL without credentials or query parameters.} enterModelId {Choose or enter a model ID.} budgetTooSmall {The model input or output budget is too small.} invalidRulesLength {Analysis rules must contain 1–4,000 characters.} rulesOverBudget {Analysis rules exceed the input budget.} segmentOverBudget {A transcript segment exceeds the input budget.} queueFull {The analysis queue is full. Original text is kept. Resolve pending tasks and retry.} saveApiKey {Save an API key in Settings.} analysisIncomplete {Analysis is incomplete. Check Diagnostics.} invalidAnalysisResult {The model returned an invalid format or quote reference. You can retry manually.} responseTooLarge {The provider response is too large.} analysisTimeout {Analysis timed out. It will retry automatically.} invalidCredentials {Invalid key or model access denied. Check Settings.} insufficientBalance {Provider balance is insufficient. Top up and retry.} rateLimited {Provider rate limit reached. It will retry automatically.} providerUnavailable {Provider temporarily unavailable. It will retry automatically.} invalidRequest {Unsupported endpoint, model or request parameters. Check Settings.} analysisPaused {Analysis paused.} invalidCertificate {Could not verify the provider’s secure connection.} unparseableResponse {The provider returned content that could not be parsed.} networkInterrupted {Network connection interrupted. It will retry automatically.} responseContractMismatch {The provider response does not match the API format.} emptyResponse {The provider returned no valid analysis.} incompleteOutput {Model output is incomplete. Check the output budget and retry.} noProviderModels {The provider returned no models. You can enter a model ID manually.} fetchModelsFailed {Could not fetch models. Check Settings or enter a model ID manually.} configurationSaveFailed {Configuration not saved. Check system secure storage availability.} finishBeforeDictation {Finish the conversation recording before dictating a template.} saveTemplateFailed {Could not save the template. Try again.} analysisNeedsRetry {Some analysis needs a retry. Recording is unaffected.} logsUnavailable {Logs are unavailable. Recording and transcription are unaffected.} recordingOperationBusy {A recording operation is in progress. Please wait.} recordingNotFound {This recording no longer exists. Return to Recordings.} invalidRecordingTitle {Enter a recording name of 1–80 characters.} recordingOpenFailed {Could not open the recording. Try again.} recordingListFailed {Could not load recordings. Pull to refresh or retry.} createNewRecordingFirst {This recording has ended. Start a new recording.} chooseRecordingFirst {Open or create a recording first.} modelLoadFailed {The model is downloaded but could not be loaded. Retry loading or switch to Small. No new download is required.} other {Operation failed. Check the status and try again.}}",
